==History==
2022
*The Mighty Miner [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 30/3/2022, in the [[Version History#Miner%20Update%20(30/3/2022)|Miner Update]].
*On 1/4/2022, an [[Version History#Optional Update (1/4/2022)|Optional Update]], fixed an issue where Mighty Miner was not being targeted correctly.
*On 8/4/2022, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (8/4/2022)|maintenance break]], decreased the Explosive Escape's cost to 1 [[Elixir]] (from 2 Elixir) and gave the Mighty Miner knockback immunity.
*On 21/4/2022, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (21/4/2022)|maintenance break]], decreased the Explosive Escape's exploding time to 1 second (from 3 seconds).
*On 4/10/2022, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(4/10/2022)|Balance Update]], decreased the Mighty Miner's hitpoints by 8%.
*On 26/10/2022, the [[Version History#2022%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(26/10/2022)|2022 Quarter 3 Update]], moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Mighty Miner from [[Training Camp]] to Royal Crypt. This also made it so that players at any [[Experience|King Level]] could unlock the Mighty Miner, as opposed to only Level 14.
*On 7/12/2022, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(7/12/2022)|Balance Update]], increased the Might Miner's speed to 90 (from 60), now classified as Fast.
*On 22/12/2022, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (22/12/2022)|maintenance break]], increased the Mighty Miner's hitpoints by 5% and decreased his speed to 60 (from 90), now classified as Medium.
2023
*On 6/6/2023, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(6/6/2023)|Balance Update]], decreased the Mighty Miner's hitpoints by 2.2%.
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
*On 21/6/2023, a [[Version History#Maintenance%20Break%20(21/6/2023)|maintenance break]], fixed the Mighty Miner’s Bomb inflicting too much damage.
*On 8/8/2023, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(8/8/2023)|Balance Update]], increased the time required to change stages to 2.25 seconds (from 2 seconds).
2024
*On 17/6/2024, the [[Version History#Goblin World Update (17/6/2024)|Goblin World Update]], decreased the Explosive Escape's damage by 1.67%.
2025
*On 8/1/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (8/1/2025)|Balance Update]], decreased the time required to change stages to 2 seconds (from 2.25 seconds).
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], allowed an underground Mighty Miner to be affected by [[Royal Chef]].

